    - target: {fileID: 4158954359239545762, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "A sander is a power tool used to smooth surfaces by abrasion with sandpaper.
        Sanders have a means to attach the sandpaper and a mechanism to move it rapidly
        contained within a housing with means to handhold it or fix it to a workbench\n\nThis
        tool can be used to prep, repair, and smooth composite rotor blades so they
        stay aerodynamic, weather-resistant, and structurally sound\n\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
